【27届校招】模型推理平台开发工程师-大装置
北京、上海校招正式研发 - 基础架构27届校园招聘职位 ID：A193617
职位描述
1、负责大模型推理 OpenAPI 平台的设计开发与持续演进;
2、负责对接不同推理引擎与推理框架，建设标准化接入平台;
3、负责高并发场景下的服务性能优化，保障系统稳定性与吞吐能力;
4、与算法、平台、产品等团队协作，推动模型能力快速接入;
5、参与核心系统架构设计、技术方案评审及工程规范建设。
职位要求
1、2027届获得本科及以上学历,计算机、人工智能等相关专业;
2、掌握 Golang 或 Python 至少一种语言,具有扎实的计算机基础，熟悉数据结构、算法、操作系统、网络等基础知识;
3、了解常用中间件以及 Docker、Kubernetes 基础原理;
4、掌握服务端常见设计模式，能够完成 API 设计和开发、服务拆分和业务功能开发;
5、对LLM类大模型应用和原理有一定了解;
6、熟悉或使用过 AI 编程工具（如 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor）辅助开发，具备利用 AI 提升研发效率的意识和能力。
投递

岗位职责
Role Overview
In this role, you will work at the forefront of AI innovation, evaluating emerging technologies and transforming cutting-edge research into scalable business solutions through rapid experimentation, technical validation, and real-world implementation. Explore and evaluate emerging AI technologies, research breakthroughs, and industry trends to identify innovative opportunities for enterprise applications.
Key Responsibilities
•Design and develop proof-of-concept (PoC) prototypes to validate the feasibility and business value of frontier AI technologies.
•Collaborate with engineering, product, and business teams to translate cutting-edge AI capabilities into practical, scalable solutions.
•Conduct technical research, benchmarking, and experimentation across modern AI technologies, including Large Language Models (LLMs), multimodal AI, AI agents, reasoning models, and related technologies.
•Contribute to the end-to-end innovation lifecycle—from technology scouting and rapid prototyping to solution validation and production adoption.
•Analyze emerging AI ecosystems and provide technical recommendations on technology selection, solution design, and implementation approaches.
•Continuously learn and share knowledge on the latest AI advancements, contributing to the organization's AI innovation culture and technical excellence.

任职要求
1. Bachelor degree or above with graduation between September 2026 and August 2027;
2. Preferred majors include Artificial Intelligence, Computer Science, Machine Learning, or other closely related quantitative disciplines;
3. Strong academic foundation in modern artificial intelligence, machine learning, and deep learning, with a demonstrated passion for frontier AI technologies;
4. Hands-on experience through AI-related research, internships, open-source contributions, or personal projects involving LLMs, multimodal AI, AI agents, or related technologies;
5. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to quickly understand new technologies and apply them to real-world business challenges;
6. Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively in a global and cross-functional environment;
7. Experience building AI applications using modern AI frameworks and tools, such as PyTorch, Hugging Face, LangChain, Semantic Kernel, AutoGen, MCP, or similar technologies, is preferred;
8. Strong curiosity and passion for exploring emerging technologies, with a track record of self-driven learning and experimentation;
9. Publications at top-tier conferences, research experience, patents, outstanding academic achievements, or experience in AI competitions, hackathons, open-source communities, or research collaborations are preferred;
10. Ability to bridge technical innovation with practical business needs and rapidly transform ideas into working prototypes is preferred.
*Special reminder
If applying for this position, please ensure that the attached resume includes an English version.

 

Interview Process:
The first two rounds of interviews will be conducted online. Final-round candidates will be invited to Beijing for an onsite event, and travel expenses will be reimbursed.

数据策略运营专员
正式
2027校园招聘
北京顺义区
职位描述
1.逻辑清晰,深入细节,能够在组长带领下独立完成业务流程分分析,包括项目过程监控和结果复盘,挖掘数据变化
趋势、指标驱动因素,为运营动作提供策略支撑;
2.依据零售管理数据需求,搭建、优化数据看板,支持管理层清晰地看到销售核心数据,识别主要业务问题;
3.支持获客业务的专项数据分析,并可结合外部市场和竞争情况提供零售市场策略建议;
4.与业务团队、产品、技术紧密合作,响应业务需求,推进数据产品能力建设,提升销售及运营团队的运营效率;
5.规划并开发AI工具,同时协同产研团队支持工具嵌入系统,支持业务团队运营提效
职位要求
1.本科及以上学历,有数据分析实习经验优先;
2.有优秀的数据敏感性和逻辑思维能力;
3.学习能力、沟通能力、抗压能力强,有责任心和自我驱动力;
4.熟练掌握EXCEL与SQL应用能力,了解并可操作PowerBI、Tableau等BI工具,掌握常用的数据分析方法,有AI工具开发经验加分。
加分项：有Python/R数据分析经验，或具备AI应用（如大模型Prompt Engineering、智能体开发）相关项目背景者优先。
